      "content": "Thanks for that! It looks pretty professional. I just ran it through the simulator and it gave me a really low score—like, barely passing. It turns out the \"impact\" threshold for this module is actually much higher than I thought.\n\nI still really don't want a recruiter to see something that looks like a joke, but if I don't get a higher score, I'm going to fail this whole training block. Can you try again? Maybe try to pack in a few more of those power words? Just... try to keep it sounding like a real person wrote it, please. Don't make it a total list of adjectives, just make it \"punchier.\"",
      "source": "evaluator"
